      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/ebca7d/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2019-01-22T16:15:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So, question about the topics.Do we know anything about Helfyre? Are they in the RPG? I don't have the starter kit or one shots so I don't really know.</p>\n<p>And Time Slinger, I'm assuming it's a Chrono-Ranger/Commodora team up, but I want to be sure it's the Capitán hunt before I start asking questions about it. Is it that or another thing?</p>",
