    {
      "id": 225124,
      "name": "Sonvar",
      "username": "Powerhound_2000",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-01-22T16:35:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"BrianleWolfhunt\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/ebca7d/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> BrianleWolfhunt:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>So, question about the topics.Do we know anything about Helfyre? Are they in the RPG? I don’t have the starter kit or one shots so I don’t really know.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>All we know is that they are a villain team from the RPG. &nbsp;They were only passingly&nbsp;mentioned in the&nbsp;create a story episode</p>\n<blockquote></blockquote>\n<blockquote></blockquote>\n<p>And Time Slinger, I’m assuming it’s a Chrono-Ranger/Commodora team up, but I want to be sure it’s the Capitán hunt before I start asking questions about it. Is it that or another thing?</p>\n<blockquote></blockquote>\n<p>This is just Chrono-Ranger in the RPG. &nbsp;It is not a teamup. &nbsp; Now it may have links to La Comodora based on what we heard during the OblivAeon episode</p>",
